{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS IS THE DEMO OF LUNCHBREAK TACTICS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Lunchbreak Tactics demo. Play with no time limit and share the same leaderboards, updates, and season resets as premium players. Unlockable content is limited. Includes 3 heroes and 3 clans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a deadly squad of animated objects to crush your opponents in this epic card battler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to escape the curse of boredom, employees at a local superstore have decided to craft a bizarre yet addictive card game during their lunch break. However, what began as a casual pastime quickly spiraled into an all-consuming obsession across the store. You\u2019re the newest trainee, eager to prove yourself and rise through the ranks of <i>Lunchbreak Tactics</i> with one goal in mind: to become the Employee of the Month ultimate card master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/6f1de85dfaed4382b36094fc37076cb5.poster.avif?t=1758118669\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/6f1de85dfaed4382b36094fc37076cb5.webm?t=1758118669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Define Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game of Lunchbreak Tactics starts with three simple but crucial choices: one hero and two clans. Your hero gives you a special passive power while the two clans determine the units you'll get during the game.  From this point on, build a squad of units to battle opponents across thirteen rounds to gain the most reputation and climb the ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match over a hundred units and dozens of heroes to create the perfect synergies. The possibilities are endless! <strong>THE DEMO CONTAINS 3 heroes and 3 clans (around 75 units).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/9743a1f8efbe683c9b87e186ffdcbcf5.poster.avif?t=1758118669\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/9743a1f8efbe683c9b87e186ffdcbcf5.webm?t=1758118669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play At Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around an asynchronous multiplayer experience, meaning that you can play at your own rhythm, when you want and as fast or slow as you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute and Quirky Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday objects are brought to life and given new roles as wizards and witches, paladins and pirates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Perfect Game for Your Lunchbreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to pick up and play yet endlessly rewarding, this is truly the perfect game for all your future lunchbreaks\u2014and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/fbeb5f4c496df6cc170460a6afcc6635.poster.avif?t=1758118669\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/fbeb5f4c496df6cc170460a6afcc6635.webm?t=1758118669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005910?t=1758118669","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st