ven new roles as wizards and witches, paladins and pirates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Perfect Game for Your Lunchbreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to pick up and play yet endlessly rewarding, this is truly the perfect game for all your future lunchbreaks\u2014and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/fbeb5f4c496df6cc170460a6afcc6635.poster.avif?t=1758118669\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/extras/fbeb5f4c496df6cc170460a6afcc6635.webm?t=1758118669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["AnyMart"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3002240","name":"Lunchbreak Tactics"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005910/e12d16f36224fd29c574a6582886ee9f6e33dea9/header.jpg?t=1758118669","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lunchbreak Tactics Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["AnyMart"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","ratin